# subs-linux.build: platform feature map for libbuild2-autoconf substitutions.
# Only non-check names (SDL_* drivers/features, DYNAPI_*, USE_*, string
# values). All HAVE_* come from autoconf checks. Optional system-lib
# drivers (X11, ALSA, ...) are set via apply-system-feature-probes.build
# from $c.find_system_header / known SONAMEs, not hardcoded here.

